-- COVERS: s 521(5), s 521(5)(a), s 521(5)(b)
-- Plain gloss: the penalty: on indictment a fine; on summary conviction a fine up to the statutory maximum.
-- src:7356 | (5) A person guilty of an offence under this section is liable—
