-- COVERS: s 523(1), s 523(1)(a), s 523(1)(b)
-- Plain gloss: s 523 applies if an auditor is ceasing to hold office at any time other than, for a private company, the end of a period for appointing auditors or, for a public company, the end of an accounts meeting.
-- src:7373 | (1) This section applies if an auditor is ceasing to hold office—
-- src:7374 | (a) in the case of a private company, at any time other than at the end of a period for appointing auditors;
-- src:7375 | (b) in the case of a public company, at any time other than at the end of an accounts meeting.
